@WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5169

### 1. Create a user
POST http://localhost:5169/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "diana", "password": "1234" }

### 2. Log in with the correct password 
POST http://localhost:5169/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "diana", "password": "1234" }

### 3. Log in with a wrong password
POST http://localhost:5169/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "diana", "password": "wrong" }

### 4. Log in with a user that doesn't exist
POST http://localhost:5169/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "nobody", "password": "1234" }